Type: Project
Title: Metabolic Reprogramming in Differentiated Thyroid Cancer Progression: A Tumor Metabolomics Analysis
Authors@R: person("Joshua", "Preston", email = "joshua.preston@emory.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9834-3017"))
Description: Untargeted LC-MS metabolomics analysis pipeline for a study of 55
    differentiated thyroid cancer specimens, comparing early-stage (AJCC I/II) with
    advanced-stage (III/IV) tumors. Includes the analysis workflow and the scripts
    that build the Metabolomics Workbench deposition.
